{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0089","name":"宁武子","evidence":["xunyu-q-o050","xunyu-q-b-ad3746f4f66bcaa5df4e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-o050-xunyu-p0089","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o050","xunyu-q-b-ad3746f4f66bcaa5df4e"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-q-b-ad3746f4f66bcaa5df4e","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ad3746f4f66bcaa5df4e","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗宁武：即宁武子，春秋时卫国的大夫。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5014f7b4499dfbd03840","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"xunyu-q-o050","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-81be3b6304675aa695f6","layer":"original","quote":"魏国初建，为尚书令。攸深密有智防〖1〗。自从太祖征伐，常谋谟帷幄〖2〗；时人及子弟，莫知其所言。﹝一﹞太祖每称曰：“公达外愚内智，外怯内勇，外弱内强；‘不伐善〖3〗，无施劳〖4〗’；‘智可及〖5〗，愚不可及〖6〗’：虽颜子、宁武不能过也〖7〗！”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
